---

import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — RepMaths"
  description="Privacy Policy for RepMaths fitness, strength, nutrition, and body composition calculators."
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: September 13, 2026</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>

<p>
  RepMaths is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy
  explains what information may be collected when you use the RepMaths
  website and how third-party services, including Google Analytics and
  Google AdSense, may process information.
</p>

<h2>Calculator Data</h2>

<p>
  RepMaths calculators are designed to perform calculations directly
  within your web browser. Information entered into a calculator, such as
  body weight, repetitions, height, or measurements, is processed locally
  by the calculator and is not intentionally transmitted to or stored on
  RepMaths servers.
</p>

<p>
  However, third-party services used on the website, including analytics
  and advertising providers, may independently collect information about
  your visit.
</p>

<h2>Google Analytics</h2>

<p>
  RepMaths may use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the
  website and to improve its performance, content, and user experience.
</p>

<p>
  Google Analytics may collect information such as usage and session data,
  approximate geographic information, browser and device information, and
  identifiers used to distinguish users or sessions. The information
  collected depends on how Google Analytics is configured on the website.
</p>

<p>
  RepMaths does not intentionally transmit personally identifiable
  information to Google Analytics through calculator inputs or other
  website functionality.
</p>

<p>
  For more information about how Google Analytics handles data, please
  refer to Google's documentation on
  <a
    href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    safeguarding data
  </a>.
</p>

<h2>Google AdSense &amp; Advertising Cookies</h2>

<p>
  RepMaths may use Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google and
  its advertising partners may use cookies, web beacons, IP addresses,
  or similar technologies to serve, measure, and personalize
  advertisements.
</p>

<p>
  Subject to applicable settings, consent requirements, and regional laws,
  advertisements may be personalized based on a user's previous visits
  to this or other websites. Third-party vendors and advertising partners
  may also place or read cookies on your browser when advertisements are
  served.
</p>

<p>
  You can manage Google's personalized advertising settings through
  <a
    href="https://adssettings.google.com"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    Google Ads Settings
  </a>.
</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>

<p>
  RepMaths may use cookies or browser storage that are necessary for
  website functionality, where applicable. Third-party services such as
  Google Analytics and Google AdSense may use their own cookies or similar
  technologies.
</p>

<p>
  You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings.
  Disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality of some websites
  or services.
</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
  RepMaths may use third-party services for analytics, advertising,
  hosting, security, or other website functionality. These services may
  process information in accordance with their own privacy policies and
  terms of service.
</p>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
  RepMaths is not specifically directed at children. We do not knowingly
  collect personal information from children through the calculator tools.
</p>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

<p>
  This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect changes to
  the website, third-party services, legal requirements, or our privacy
  practices. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page indicates
  when the policy was most recently revised.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>

<p>
  If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how RepMaths handles
  information, please visit our
  <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
</p>

  </article>  <style>
    .legal-page {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .legal-page h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .legal-page p {
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-page a {
      color: var(--accent);
    }
  </style></Base>
